{"text": "With the last piece of bread Tom King wiped his plate clean of the last drop of flour gravy, and then he chewed the mouthful slowly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The flour for the gravy had been borrowed from a neighbor, and the last two halfpennies in the house had gone to buy the bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children had been sent to bed early so that they might sleep through the missing supper, and his wife, Lizzie, had eaten nothing at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked every inch a fighter, with a flattened nose, a swollen ear, a heavy jaw, and sleepy, lion like eyes under heavy lids. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yet he was not a cruel man, and outside the ring he had never once picked a quarrel, for to him fighting was simply a business. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked down at his hands, at the swollen veins and the battered knuckles, and he knew that his body was growing old and tired. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I wish I had a piece of steak, he said, and Lizzie told him that both butchers had refused to give them any more credit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Burke the butcher had even said that Sandel would probably beat him that night, though in the old days Burke would have trusted him with a thousand steaks.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "p", "i", "e", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "b", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "T", "o", "m", " ", "K", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "i", "p", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "p", "l", "a", "t", "e", " ", "c", "l", "e", "a", "n", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "d", "r", "o", "p", " ", "o", "f", " ", "f", "l", "o", "u", "r", " ", "g", "r", "a", "v", "y", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "e", "w", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "u", "t", "h", "f", "u", "l", " ", "s", "l", "o", "w", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "